{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36456","headline":"秋晚 · 罗邺","name":"秋晚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残星残月一声钟，谷际岩隈爽气浓。\n不向碧台惊醉梦，但来青镜促愁容。\n繁金露洁黄笼菊，独翠烟凝远涧松。\n闲步幽林与苔径，渐移栖鸟及鸣蛩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}